{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T07:39:43+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-12T07:39:43+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Dino Polska S.A.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Grocery Stores","country":"Poland","city":"Krotoszyn","website":"https://www.grupadino.pl","employees":59597,"summary":"Dino Polska S.A., together with its subsidiaries, operates a network of medium-sized grocery supermarkets under the Dino brand in Poland. The company stores offer fresh food products, such as meat, poultry, cold cuts, fruits and vegetables, dairy products, and bread; other groceries, including children's food, breakfast products, ready to eat meals, beverages, candies, snacks, frozen goods, processed goods, oils, grain and bulk products, condiments, and alcohol and cigarettes; and non-grocery products comprising flowers, cleaning agents, sanitary articles, pet food, seasonal products, and small household appliances. It also produces meat products; rents and operates owned and leased real estate; purchases and sells real estate properties; and manufactures and processes refined petroleum products, as well as offers other financial services. In addition, it engages in the retail sale of automotive fuel in specialized stores; operation of warehousing and storage facilities; retail sales run by mail order houses or the internet; and advertising agency activities. The company was founded in 1999 and is based in Krotoszyn, Poland.","exchange":"Warsaw","currency":"PLN","financial_currency":"PLN","summary_fr":"Dino Polska S.A., avec ses filiales, exploite un réseau de supermarchés de taille moyenne sous la marque Dino en Pologne. Les magasins de la société offrent des produits alimentaires frais, tels que la viande, la volaille, la charcuterie, les fruits et légumes, les produits laitiers et le pain; d'autres produits d'épicerie, y compris les aliments pour enfants, les produits pour le petit-déjeuner, les repas prêts à manger, les boissons, les bonbons, les collations, les produits congelés, les produits transformés, les huiles, les céréales et les produits en vrac, l'alcool et les cigarettes; et les produits non alimentaires. Elle produit également des produits carnés, loue et exploite des biens immobiliers détenus et loués, achète et vend des biens immobiliers, fabrique et transforme des produits pétroliers raffinés et offre d'autres services financiers."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":37059121152,"shares_outstanding":980400000,"trailing_pe":23.625,"forward_pe":2.079208,"price_to_book":3.7615683,"ev_to_ebitda":14.158,"ev_to_revenue":1.015,"dividend_yield":0.0,"payout_ratio":0.0,"beta_yahoo":0.442},"targets":{"current_price":37.8,"mean":35.45294,"median":36.0,"high":42.9,"low":22.7,"n_analysts":17,"reco_mean":2.52941,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-05"],"eps_avg":0.4105,"eps_low":0.39519,"eps_high":0.42582,"revenue_avg":10024070270,"ex_dividend":null,"dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.51163,"institutions_pct":0.17292999,"institutions_float_pct":0.35409,"institutions_n":221,"institutions":[{"name":"Generali Investments Cee, Investicni Spolecnost, A.s.","pct":0.001,"shares":992960,"value":37533887,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0072000003,"shares":7022159,"value":265437604,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.002},{"name":"iShares, Inc.-iShares Core MSCI Emerging Markets ETF","pct":0.0057,"shares":5590527,"value":211321916,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":0.0089},{"name":"Fidelity Investment Trust-Fidelity Emerging Markets Fund","pct":0.005,"shares":4883606,"value":184600303,"date":"2026-09-30","chg":-0.0232},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0047999998,"shares":4687615,"value":177191843,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.008},{"name":"EA Series Trust-Freedom 100 Emerging Ma